sequence Treasure Acquisition Protocol

tag Phase as p
  Reconnaissance blue
  Negotiation green
  Acquisition orange
  Logistics purple

CaptainBlackbeard is an actor p: Reconnaissance

[Intelligence]
  NavigationOfficer p: Reconnaissance
  CartographyEngine p: Reconnaissance

[Negotiation Bureau] p: Negotiation
  DiplomacyHandler
  TradeAgreementProcessor
  MerchantLiaison

[Treasure Vault] p: Acquisition
  VaultAccessController
  InventoryManager
  GoldCountingEngine

[Fleet Operations] p: Logistics
  CargoManifestService
  ShipDispatcher

== Reconnaissance Phase ==
CaptainBlackbeard -request treasure map-> NavigationOfficer p: Reconnaissance
NavigationOfficer -plot coordinates-> CartographyEngine p: Reconnaissance
CartographyEngine -validate route-> CartographyEngine p: Reconnaissance
CartographyEngine -charted route-> NavigationOfficer

note right of NavigationOfficer
  Route validated against
  known reef hazards
  and rival fleet positions

NavigationOfficer -route briefing-> CaptainBlackbeard

== Negotiation Phase ==
CaptainBlackbeard -initiate trade parley-> DiplomacyHandler p: Negotiation
DiplomacyHandler -assess merchant terms-> TradeAgreementProcessor p: Negotiation
TradeAgreementProcessor -verify merchant reputation-> MerchantLiaison p: Negotiation

loop until terms accepted
  MerchantLiaison -counter offer-> DiplomacyHandler
  DiplomacyHandler -evaluate terms-> DiplomacyHandler
  if terms acceptable
    DiplomacyHandler -ratify agreement-> TradeAgreementProcessor
  else
    DiplomacyHandler -revise demands-> MerchantLiaison

TradeAgreementProcessor -signed treaty-> CaptainBlackbeard

== Acquisition Phase ==
CaptainBlackbeard -authorize vault access-> VaultAccessController p: Acquisition
VaultAccessController -unlock vault-> VaultAccessController p: Acquisition

note right of VaultAccessController
  Two-key authentication
  required for vault access

VaultAccessController -begin inventory-> InventoryManager p: Acquisition
InventoryManager -count doubloons-> GoldCountingEngine p: Acquisition
GoldCountingEngine -tally complete-> InventoryManager
InventoryManager -manifest ready-> VaultAccessController

== Dispatch Phase ==
VaultAccessController -transfer manifest-> CargoManifestService p: Logistics
CargoManifestService -allocate fleet-> ShipDispatcher p: Logistics
ShipDispatcher -dispatch convoy-> ShipDispatcher p: Logistics
ShipDispatcher -fleet deployed-> CargoManifestService
CargoManifestService -shipment confirmed-> CaptainBlackbeard
